            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi kayiprofweti mazu awa ejima, wakayili neyi, Yehova wakabuluma mwiwulu, izu dindi dakahosha mwindi mwajila; wakabulumina iyinda dindi naŋovu; wakadikuwa chakuzuwila antu ejima aheseki, neyi chadikuwaŋawu adatolaŋa nyikabu yavinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipumba dakashika nikunsa yeseki; muloŋa Yehova wukweti nsaŋu yakuhosha nanyuza, wakasompa muloŋa nawantu ejima; hakwila akwaku koŋa chatama wakayihanakumpo kuya kabali. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
