          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu atubiŋa, kalokenu mudili; enu awakulumpi amumukanka wanyikoku, alaŋanenu mumawuti; muloŋa mafuku enu akuyŋahola anashiki dehi chikupu, nukuyikotola kotu kotu, mwakaholoka neyi nsaba yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubiŋa hiyakamona njila yakutemukilaku, awakulumpi ahamukanka wanyikoku hiyakamona hawupulukiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O chakadilawu atubiŋa! O chakakalokawu awakulumpi ahamukanka wanyikoku! Muloŋa Yehova hakutamisha hawudiilu wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumayinda mwadiŋi mwamwena munanoŋi dehi nakuzuwa kwaYehova kwasweja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naleki dehi hakabolototu kindi, neyi chikwa namutupa. Muloŋa ituŋa dawu dabalumuka dehi dakuhayama hohu, nanochu chaswejayi dehi mukwakukabisha, nakuzuwa kwindi kwasweja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
